    You can target 1 "Noble Knight" Monster Card in your Spell & Trap Zone; Special
    Summon it, also, if you activated this effect while you did not control "Infernoble
    Knight Emperor Charles", you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this
    turn, except Warrior monsters.'
